  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Livelihood Response Programme in South Sudan 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed project is to reduce dependency on humanitarian aid by protecting the livelihoods of the most vulnerable population groups while building their resilience. To achieve this, project activities will be aligned with the outcome ?Livelihoods the most vulnerable households protected?.</narrative>
